artifact-controller

This project adapts design patterns, API conventions, and reconciler idioms
from the following Apache-2.0 licensed projects:

- fluxcd/source-controller and fluxcd/pkg (Copyright The Flux authors):
  runtime conditions/patch machinery, kstatus-compatible condition taxonomy
  (Ready/Reconciling/Stalled), interval/suspend API conventions, jittered
  requeue convention.
- cert-manager (Copyright The cert-manager Authors): the intent-object /
  owned-attempt-object split, failure-budget backoff semantics, and the
  retry-by-annotation escape hatch.
- Crossplane (Copyright The Crossplane Authors): the external-store driver
  contract shape (Observe/Delete) and deletion-policy vocabulary
  (Orphan/Delete).
